{"4693300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hole Punch Cocktail", "steam_appid": 4693300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Hole Punch Cocktail]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/78a295f3bc14ec5123153664b21bb1ac.poster.avif?t=1779943459\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/78a295f3bc14ec5123153664b21bb1ac.webm?t=1779943459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/78a295f3bc14ec5123153664b21bb1ac.mp4?t=1779943459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hole Punch Cocktail</strong> is a surreal FPS set inside an office worker’s dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must venture into the subconscious of a young female employee struggling with mild alcoholism, and help her survive a full day’s work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed only with alcohol, drinks, and office-supply guns, you'll have to face the twisted realities and threats lurking within her dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Alcohol Management Combat]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/3cb05bc9b6f61ec554e42ddd1549028b.poster.avif?t=1779943459\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/3cb05bc9b6f61ec554e42ddd1549028b.webm?t=1779943459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/3cb05bc9b6f61ec554e42ddd1549028b.mp4?t=1779943459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can raise or lower their alcohol gauge by consuming alcohol or beverages on cooldown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the alcohol gauge rises, your weapon's average firepower increases, but your mobility and accuracy decrease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Conversely, when the gauge drops, your mobility and accuracy improve, but your average firepower decreases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must fluidly manage your alcohol gauge to adapt to the situation and gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making accurate judgments and actions will make combat more manageable by reducing drink cooldowns or increasing ammo drops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep pouring, keep drinking, and keep killing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Office Supplies gun]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/aa10411ae5f5614f1a91191e614e4a4a.poster.avif?t=1779943459\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/aa10411ae5f5614f1a91191e614e4a4a.webm?t=1779943459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/aa10411ae5f5614f1a91191e614e4a4a.mp4?t=1779943459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are office supplies, guns, and weapons to help you get through daily tasks that feel like a war in a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Magnum Punch</strong> with a built-in Bluetooth (literally, a blue tooth) to blast holes in enemies from a distance, or fire a barrage of keycaps with the <strong>QWERTY-9</strong> to engrave pain into them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the characteristics of each weapon and their synergy with the alcohol gauge to use them efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Twisted Office Workers]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/4794ea9ad22fc1594ac31515c7776c05.poster.avif?t=1779943459\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/4794ea9ad22fc1594ac31515c7776c05.webm?t=1779943459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/4794ea9ad22fc1594ac31515c7776c05.mp4?t=1779943459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted office workers from your dreams appear to ruin your daily tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of enemies will show up, from the intern-level 'Working Dead' to the 'Clipboard Clerk' who uses a massive clipboard as a shield, and the 'Dead Angle' disrupting you from a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand the abilities of your enemies and choose the right strategy.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Hole Punch Cocktail]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/78a295f3bc14ec5123153664b21bb1ac.poster.avif?t=1779943459\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/78a295f3bc14ec5123153664b21bb1ac.webm?t=177994345