gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making accurate judgments and actions will make combat more manageable by reducing drink cooldowns or increasing ammo drops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep pouring, keep drinking, and keep killing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Office Supplies gun]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/aa10411ae5f5614f1a91191e614e4a4a.poster.avif?t=1779943459\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/aa10411ae5f5614f1a91191e614e4a4a.webm?t=1779943459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/aa10411ae5f5614f1a91191e614e4a4a.mp4?t=1779943459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are office supplies, guns, and weapons to help you get through daily tasks that feel like a war in a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>Magnum Punch</strong> with a built-in Bluetooth (literally, a blue tooth) to blast holes in enemies from a distance, or fire a barrage of keycaps with the <strong>QWERTY-9</strong> to engrave pain into them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the characteristics of each weapon and their synergy with the alcohol gauge to use them efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Twisted Office Workers]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4693300/extras/4794ea9ad22fc1594ac31515c7776c05.poster.avif?t=177994345